  "description": "Gong Eun-tae, an ordinary sales employee you can find anywhere, wins the jackpot in the lottery—something he had only dreamed of! After taxes, he takes home 1.8 billion won. A large sum, but is it really enough to turn his life upside down?\n\n*\"Let’s just live as I always have… I'll think of the lottery as insurance for my peace of mind.\"*\n\nWith that reassuring safety net, he takes the leap— and suddenly, everything he does starts going unbelievably well?! Today, Eun-tae heads to work once again! But this time, with a whole new mindset.\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
